{"about_the_game":"Run, jump, and reverse the flow of gravity itself to escape the mind of a selfish god in this challenging precision platformer. Play as Maya, a child stolen from her family on the whim of a lonely, forsaken deity, and make your way through over 100 screens filled with spikes, lasers, switches, and traps as you unravel the horrifying secret of your new prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.poster.avif?t=1771856126\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.webm?t=1771856126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.mp4?t=1771856126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gorgeous hand-drawn pixel art graphics bring the god\u2019s realm to life alongside meticulously handcrafted animations boasting many thousands of frames<br></li><li> A lush, atmospheric score, equal parts unsettling and beautiful<br></li><li> Responsive, snappy controls provide challenges with a sense of mastery and acrobatic accomplishment<br></li><li> A psychological horror narrative contorts and unfolds to reveal choices beyond comprehension</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.poster.avif?t=1771856126\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.webm?t=1771856126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.mp4?t=1771856126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you find your way home, or wander these halls carved of memory forever?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"UNDERCASTLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/64dded92062067b0f44411332aee8aed0e161eec.jpg"},{"name":"LOS ANGELES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/2b1d54e8256cb4f43cc2e9019bd581ca638c78cd.jpg"},{"name":"BIRTHDAY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/1ee8b5942a615c4d5c23d4a2aa18b1d060f6ce7e.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST DAY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/d409a029e3e21dd6e29f2a9a7108caee8ed97b8b.jpg"},{"name":"ESCAPE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/ffa66e7487b6555138ab0cd51411dfff33d7b498.jpg"},{"name":"THE HEART","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/789b1d1d4215f7ad802f6a013949f046e5d06889.jpg"},{"name":"SISTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/e5e58bd710420ad9fdad9b27ceb8badf0f848b4f.jpg"},{"name":"SECOND DAY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/65e3d238a1e3ab88ef6002e0277e1d9d7d376725.jpg"},{"name":"THIRD DAY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/0397fdee516e0ab5e9984639508caee74af3508f.jpg"},{"name":"FOURTH DAY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010610/7203fc7c338af6b621782b7f3c089113b8ca7afe.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010610?t=1771856126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771856126","c