do","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":210},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"19 Feb, 2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cIf you\u2019re someone who finds themselves complaining about the state of modern games, you owe it to yourself to play Love Eternal. Even if platformers aren\u2019t your go-to genre, the story is a strong enough motivator to see it through. If you do like platformers, well, you\u2019re in for a treat.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Shacknews<br><br>\u201cLove Eternal delivers on the promise of a psychological-horror platformer in most ways. Its setting and presentation create a world where you're never quite sure what reality you're in... The game gets more meta in ways than I could've predicted, and left my own brain scrambled entirely by the end of the short four-hour experience.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 DualShockers<br><br>\u201cParalysis in the midst of ever-moving fluidity. Mundanity masking unworldly phenomena. Understanding despite an immortal incomprehensibility. This is the essence of Love Eternal... the game marries irresistible, gravity-bending challenges with an enigmatic and magnetic plot. Even if sometimes you want to, you\u2019ll be hard put to stop.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 The Indie Informer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/ss_9966a8c785a3d069b461a0c7c80e4af4407764fd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771856126","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/ss_9966a8c785a3d069b461a0c7c80e4af4407764fd.600x338.jpg?t=1771856126"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/ss_4d0acdb02f1912586e1969c70d4240b5fe6f50a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771856126","path_thumbnail"